                                for Policy Application, Office of the Director, Broadcast Service,
                                United States Information Agency

Crosby, John, U.S. radio and television
                                critic, New York Herald Tribune;
                                syndicated columnist

Gore, Albert, Senator (D-Tennessee);
                                Chairman, Near East Subcommittee of the Senate Foreign Relations
                                Committee

Harkins, Paul D., General, USA;
                                Commander of the Military Advisory Command, Vietnam, from February
                                8, 1962

Krulak, Victor H., Major General, USMC;
                                Special Assistant for Counterinsurgency and Special Activities,
                                Joint Staff of the Joint Chiefs of Staff

